### Get all courses
GET http://localhost:5031/api/courses

### Get specific course
GET http://localhost:5031/api/courses/1

### Get user registrations
GET http://localhost:5031/api/registrations/user/1

### Register user for a course
POST http://localhost:5031/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 3,
    "courseId": 3
}

### Unregister user from a course
DELETE http://localhost:5031/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 1,
    "courseId": 1,
    "reason": "Schedule conflict"
}

### Get course registrations
GET http://localhost:5031/api/courses/1/registrations